  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Apportez-le au moment du dessert, s'il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "99d17de5edcefa9efafb71c44a57ba94b7755a96f94fcdce01e2470bae4e749f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr. Il y a un problème avec le plat ?",
      "textSHA256": "c09623ce182e8f71a7448555cca099e87714a1f5bd313fe68b2c27edc0686377",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr. Nous avons aussi un café torréfié dans la région.",
      "textSHA256": "522e432d8569f602bd712310f2f6f6cac5b2ed818589b96f96d6d49056633fb4",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr. Votre famille arrive-t-elle en même temps ?",
      "textSHA256": "72954c9460a93e3b70c004ab09d832c69e796d35df550d9b4b204449a4229622",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir, j'ai une réservation pour ce soir au nom de Martin.",
      "textSHA256": "455cd07ba1e506c0110cd9448b7bb36ad654d2af86a4995fa51ecebd4570cf3f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir, je peux vous aider avec votre réservation ?",
      "textSHA256": "bea6e9ab3ea3a422fbc206b9ea8699e56838c3f7b7d9e9d4851a3471c5d6627f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "C'est l'anniversaire de ma femme.",
      "textSHA256": "2a88c25989a20929be1158f0b3c9681c43358dd9d8f39240c274d6ae1a6a4da1",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "C'est noté. Je vous confirmerai le gâteau avant votre arrivée.",
      "textSHA256": "4b0c10f2cc8089f8592aa1d8dd8012d862a8dac6f3b7a30e5a540b90201025ee",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "C'est une surprise ; merci de ne rien dire.",
      "textSHA256": "a5a13018efcedaef65ac2f1de0d3d0c75ba597d57491c78b83151d0b2ffebbb9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "C'est une surprise pour mon mari ; merci de ne rien dire.",
      "textSHA256": "a4571de45c92667cf4323af38da7bb3724fa631614979953ee07e1a8b51682cf",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ce café vient-il de la région ?",
      "textSHA256": "7629b4c86432f3309e10732e7dd724563b3dfcaa3121ce4401c3443c8899a10e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Combien de temps faudra-t-il pour le nouveau plat ?",
      "textSHA256": "c38fedd6142ee29156b59e075ad129ffdd8c1d661e74a9952492272b6aab0d55",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Environ quinze minutes. Je reviens vous confirmer cela.",
      "textSHA256": "2e0de75ced08ee9991f76dd9f8f453b293620874d02c57e03567052638255f23",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Excusez-moi, pouvez-vous venir un instant ?",
      "textSHA256": "44fef92ebeb72775d05027ee2a689aa9c0e6cc5d8dbd6144578e30667cacf699",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ils arriveront un peu plus tard. Pourriez-vous apporter un dessert avec une bougie ?",
      "textSHA256": "54f71661055fcddacd72cf4e7b492f2ed56e646b3c3e871ea6bf4ce677538c0d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "J'ai commandé du poisson, mais on m'a apporté de la viande.",
      "textSHA256": "3786d8326cdaced65dc1fa8833fc2a6d078032df35bc1fc29a798da02dfb2433",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "J'ai commandé le poulet à la sauce aux champignons.",
      "textSHA256": "706929baf17f1a710d905a10bfc02a3138414af1f63eb75358c96cf79bba2996",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je crois que ce n'est pas ce que j'ai commandé.",
      "textSHA256": "0bad3eefb154f58962b6d7dc3f9ffec8e3a961a4c22e99600b912c8323b9141a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je prendrai la crème caramel à partager. Puis-je avoir un café allongé ?",
      "textSHA256": "cf488d91a9e970249f1de9f057973c120ed0cbcb9b091879a3f9e21e06b78934",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je suis désolé. Je vais demander à la cuisine de le refaire.",
      "textSHA256": "cd9efd19faefa0a430dd376ef397b8649e2d44e4b3ba3b8ec7f2a1ef1e0cbc1e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vais confirmer le gâteau avec la cuisine et vous rappeler.",
      "textSHA256": "a4db2c0d32dd7d59d045b4301c9ed34040ec8a4e16f1c69d91553490e2a4463f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vais faire corriger les commandes et revenir avec une estimation du temps.",
      "textSHA256": "3df882db153f24a660ca0eeebc8eefa4d8968e08e54c1d4c9d15f1d8a6340161",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais goûter une petite eau-de-vie de poire.",
      "textSHA256": "14debecb4c3161559ffe821e3aceeaf9bf67abca748daca316718d29c5def9af",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais goûter une petite eau-de-vie.",
      "textSHA256": "5f7333cca7d91695d0726db1bfecdd3c454259f841d04d7c90a7b8420b84795d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vous apporte la crème caramel à partager et les boissons.",
      "textSHA256": "09c6a7c0e35fcc6c4fa29878e74d0529b1900d86d3d8065db152c032797e9c2e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "L'addition, s'il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "48d37195a9ea9e3db5115ee7557be04c9f3408b2faf195e59077dbd406f9b395",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La crème caramel et le gâteau au chocolat sont très demandés.",
      "textSHA256": "32fe50b53e85cfb339507dfd4ebe4c0da9bdeecdafffad0cc684b0a6538275bf",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le poulet est cru à l'intérieur ; je ne peux pas le manger ainsi.",
      "textSHA256": "f68f07b7514336156b10d7f326e03a45160624a5dc1e4c6ee7223b638356e145",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci. Apportez-le au moment du dessert, s'il vous plaît. Nous porterons un toast après.",
      "textSHA256": "6210072958082f0186c1f860d8427fc209ca543abc52931edc90c94c7da1465e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci. Combien de temps faudra-t-il pour les nouveaux plats ?",
      "textSHA256": "ec47b667c57e4ecb0a59db6252e5500e06cc53faf5e8f7768a9fb971627174e2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci. L'addition, s'il vous plaît, après le dessert.",
      "textSHA256": "aa0b3c2cb2b5b0e851f3aac161442484be60db912a0e23427df64cedc01bd95b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous fêtons notre anniversaire de mariage avec notre famille.",
      "textSHA256": "c203bf8c7700e46f2808b36fc7db80840624087b57ea6954748e8a1a1e12d927",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous fêtons notre anniversaire de mariage.",
      "textSHA256": "c699efb1bde3bcf25a9d16b7ec25b29bf3ffc7d2186f632e8a75d622196ab0c7",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous pouvons préparer un petit gâteau. Je vais confirmer la disponibilité avec la cuisine.",
      "textSHA256": "a14f660444b48ad9c8cfdeb6dc148fb6e730902290f2928506ec5fb589a6e611",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous proposons une eau-de-vie de poire et une liqueur aux plantes comme digestifs.",
      "textSHA256": "0619b57560331de7c478375918b623910d7693b37de9207456937ec88b0ec958",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous voudrions un dessert à partager.",
      "textSHA256": "650d7e977dcb6663ecda88c7a88d4cdac4a206b389491482a21b709af2869990",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nous voudrions un dessert à partager. Avez-vous aussi une assiette de fromages ?",
      "textSHA256": "d64749eecf9217d08e06b6c80d1d2b5be6e6204ddd372eb1f5dea45122d63db3",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, je vais faire corriger les deux commandes.",
      "textSHA256": "e2ba888fded846739a06e8970e4ecacab00cba3547d8018188df08c4852b1a40",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, madame Martin. Que puis-je faire pour vous ?",
      "textSHA256": "5e62f3a943f8d790f48c58d2a9f4b6af7fca0bac217b3eb0cfeb96d3fcbc45ed",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, nous servons une assiette de fromages d'Alsace.",
      "textSHA256": "5263859eb9fc90fbbd7f2c928e3d2cef99a003b8000f9a28cd0b3877dbc7b5b8",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous apporter un dessert avec une bougie ?",
      "textSHA256": "12582c227854a3ff3c81f4b78f0b09cd4982e2dd029460e0ac14d7d9822f6468",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous le faire cuire davantage ?",
      "textSHA256": "4cb3602f7df12a3e189aabd5fffbb4d498a79897d4467d6b476b894487e24150",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous m'expliquer ce qu'il y a dans ce dessert ?",
      "textSHA256": "ebbd4624592aa7b88fdc0a747afb3b720d4385979e7dd49a527c24107ea8e134",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous me le remplacer, s'il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "433542f12d3a523555b2e96f01e26a36cd686ce4969cea9420587ea0e03c3262",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Qu'est-ce que vous pouvez préparer pour l'occasion ?",
      "textSHA256": "4714e70e917809b24622decfc2928a85f90de9151df3a2b982f70a10aa72d328",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:10:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Que boit-on ici après le dîner ?",
      "textSHA256": "cc8b78f80bc42d07389caa97e084aba8a993cc3975fa684d3c27a00bf912f2c0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Que recommandez-vous avec le fromage ?",
      "textSHA256": "96955cad8fdb8e527c2a5506a75a4650f92bf03e0ff14f9fcb188d54e4ba02b2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Quels desserts proposez-vous ce soir ?",
      "textSHA256": "afd7cfe3081e2d2eef0713b80b8c4b3963fdc494606a3e04ac1e3aa546fd2d11",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 11
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Souhaitez-vous voir la carte des desserts ou des fromages ?",
      "textSHA256": "b8079c2281fa002dea398257b62407d533a27d5f5fb22ce085bfc82a5de96895",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Tout se passe bien avec vos plats ?",
      "textSHA256": "6b80edafb377dad2bd9ebce82ecea5fbeca991734dabb5df3b998d460abcfd0e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Très bien : une crème caramel à partager, un café allongé et une petite eau-de-vie de poire.",
      "textSHA256": "3f5a5020b946f64b7de29c74e208a4c1145d0e2258c16ecfc193b81a2dfd0d96",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:12:fr-en",
